Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:43.34,Hdr,,0,0,0,,November 25, 2012 - Japan Cup
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:03.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tenno Sho winner Bito Black leads - still going, still going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:06.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,400 metres to go - Bito Black in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:08.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,And out wide, Orfevre
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:11.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Through the gap, Gentildonna - these two are coming
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:14.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Two horses in the same silks, fighting their way up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:17.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Orfevre outside, Gentildonna through the gap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.40,0:00:21.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Triple Tiara filly Gentildonna, Triple Crown winner Orfevre
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:23.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,It's turned into a two-horse match race
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:28.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,A ferocious match race, bumping and battling - who will it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.10,0:00:29.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,They hit the line together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:33.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Which one is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:38.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Triple Tiara winner Gentildonna inside, Triple Crown winner Orfevre outside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:42.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Pride against pride - neither one would give an inch!